IMPORT prelude

-- Medical Treatment Planning and Decisions Act 2016 (Vic) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- It uses only the built-in date functions (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL), not the daydate library.
-- The Act counts in plain days: "not more than 14 days after receiving that notification" (s 67(2)); "within 28 days
-- after the day that the order ... is made" (s 88(3)).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Medical
-- Treatment Planning and Decisions Act 2016, Version No. 012 (1 July 2024), not the authorised version. (c) State of
-- Victoria; published with the authority of the Government Printer for the State of Victoria. No part may be reproduced
